{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite the strength of the Vampires and the Werewolves and combine their defences in a unlikely alliance to defend from the humans. Select your moves between playing cards, earning food or unlocking stronger decks to survive their rampage. Choose your desired rewards and build unique decks to survive their next attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a twist in the deckbuilding experience. In each turn  the player must choose which deck to use rather than what card to play. Select which of your decks to upgrade and fill your arsenal with enchanted cards. Utilize your skills and use them to stand your ground and overwhelm the opossing force by creating powerfull combos and synergies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect balance between unlocking decks and defending from your opponent</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between Seven classes with unique mechanics each with their own cards or skills\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your decks with a wide variety of enchanted cards to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more skills and further upgrade your defenses with more than 15 skills to gain, making each run unique and more compatible with any playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the game and continue to explore your strength through different strategies in Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your skills through five difficulty levels each one adding an extra obstacle or shortcoming to deal with</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to howl in the moon and fly to the darkness</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You can do this","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088570/31d84dc75f4963ba5a85cff9d2a3776524742433.jpg"},{"name":"A way out